The GAN Robot protocol (BLE UUIDs and move encoding) was learned from
rsimp/gan-scrambler (https://github.com/rsimp/gan-scrambler). That repository
has no license, so no code was copied; GanRobotProtocol.kt is an independent
implementation of the documented wire format.

